# Linear governance — iPixai

When planning operator AI work, Linear must show who owns what and what is Done — not a stale markdown tracker. Agents that trust repo summaries invent wrong blockers.

**Real-world iPix:** Operator signs in → org resolves → CopilotKit chat → Production Planner. Governance mistakes hide the real failure (wrong project, fake Done, missing org membership).

## Scope

Stable **how** to use Linear. Never treat this file as SSOT for dates, statuses, cycle windows, or ownership — those live in **live Linear**.

Companions: `task-naming.mdc` · `linear-task-format.mdc` · Linear MCP (`plugin-linear-linear`). Issue body SSOT: `docs/linear/linear-format.md`.

## Source of truth

| Information | Authority |
|-------------|-----------|
| Status, project, milestone, cycle, priority, owner | Live Linear |
| Code | git HEAD + open PR |
| Production behavior | Browser / production probe |
| Requirements / AC | Canonical issue |
| Repo docs (`docs/mastra/`, trackers) | Summary only — may be stale |

Conflict → **report**, do not silently overwrite.

## Access & safety

| Prefer | Fallback |
|--------|----------|
| Linear MCP (`plugin-linear-linear`) | GraphQL + `LINEAR_API_KEY` only when MCP cannot set a field |

Never print secrets. Never delete projects/issues unless asked. Bulk/destructive → propose first, apply after approval. Discover MCP tools each session.

## Naming & one concern

- Titles / first mention: **`IPI-NNN · TASK-ID — Plain English`** (`task-naming.mdc`)
- Team: **iPix1** (`IPI`) unless the user names another team
- One independently testable outcome per issue/PR
- Never mix unrelated docs + production code

## Status & Done

| State | When |
|-------|------|
| Backlog | Unscheduled |
| Todo | Ready to start |
| In Progress | Actively executing |
| Done | ACs met + evidence (git, tests, **browser** or honest N/A) — never status-copy alone |
| Duplicate | `duplicateOf` set |
| Canceled | Explicitly abandoned |

Reopen Done only with approval (unless the task authorizes correction). Record the unmet AC first.

## Read → mutate → verify

**Read-only:** discover MCP → list filtered issues → spot-check → compare to git (label STALE) → PASS / NEEDS FIXES; mutate only when asked.

**Mutate:** confirm approval → change fields → re-read live.

## Issue create / rewrite checklist

- [ ] Dedupe by title/identifier
- [ ] Full title + team IPI
- [ ] Body matches `docs/linear/linear-format.md` (implementation prompt first, ≤5 official URLs, `task-verifier` on the skills list)
- [ ] Correct project + milestone
- [ ] Hard `blockedBy` / `blocks` when needed

## AI task execution (short)

```text
1 Explain simply · 2 Real iPix workflow · 3 Research official docs + repo
4 Audit existing code · 5 Reuse before build · 6 Plan · 7 Implement
8 Tests · 9 Browser when UI changed · 10 Docs · 11 Linear · 12 DoD
```

**Done requires:** ACs · tests · browser (or honest N/A) · docs · Linear updated · fail-closed auth preserved.

PR body: `pr-description.mdc`.

## Anti-patterns

| ❌ Don’t | ✅ Do |
|---------|--------|
| Trust markdown dates | Live Linear |
| Bare `IPI-249` in user text | Full **IPI-249 · TASK-ID — …** |
| Mark Done from a sibling merge | Evidence for **this** issue |
| Weaken fail-closed auth for a green `/info` | Fix data/env |
